<title>USA: HFNC sets special cash distribution.</title>
<headline>HFNC sets special cash distribution.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFNC Financial Corp said Tuesday it plans to spend about $86 million to pay a special cash distribution of $5 per share.</p>
<p>The distribution is to be paid March 18 to shareholders of record as of the close of business on March 4. It has about 17,192,500 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>HFNC is the holding company for Home Federal Savings and Loan Association.</p>
